OL,3,GNEWSAMurder victim's mum backs plan to 
OL,4,Atackle knife crime                     
OL,6,FA mum whose son was stabbed to death   
OL,7,Fsaid fresh funding to tackle knife     
OL,8,Fcrime in Nottinghamshire should be     
OL,9,Finvested in early prevention.          
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police has been awarded
OL,12,F#450,000 to tackle the problem in eight
OL,13,Fareas: the Broadmarsh, Old Market      
OL,14,FSquare and Victoria Centre in          
OL,15,FNottingham city centre, Hucknall,      
OL,16,FBeeston, Mansfield town centre, the    
OL,17,FRavensdale area of Mansfield and       
OL,18,FSutton-in-Ashfield.                    
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
