OL,3,GNEWSAMurder victim's mum backs plan to 
OL,4,Atackle knife crime                     
OL,6,FPolice said those areas accounted for  
OL,7,F10% of knife crime across the force    
OL,8,Farea and would now "be subject to a    
OL,9,Fpartnership problem-solving process".  
OL,11,FZoe Cooke, whose son Byron Griffin was 
OL,12,Fmurdered in 2021, said it was          
OL,13,F"fantastic" the force had been awarded 
OL,14,Fthe money to make areas safer.         
